<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-11T21:01:59.683Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:01:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces continue massing near opposition leaders' homes while rival groups have seized three towns, and the UN is urging a halt to fighting in Baidoa as famine, displacement and flood risks worsen. A UAE drone strike in Puntland killed a Somali family, and Al-Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six people. Somali pirates remain active, with Pakistani families receiving compensation for victims and survivors of a hijacking returning home. The Somali diaspora in Minnesota faces rising threats linked to amplified anti-Somali rhetoric in the United States. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMXEzQkZkeU1HQmlsNzFDUUhDbnVmbngtbVZGd2tZNGhjaUtzWEZqQ0pvSTF4bW16ZjljbWU2YlBkdl9OVFFJRE5xVXJoVXZCZGI4cl9ubDdrNnlpUXBiUUJLOVdKZ1hRbG52RjAyYWY2VTByS0V5a3BuYzM0dDNpZ0ViT2pNcEZ4dW1ITmFoajNwaW9zNWZLTkxQM3JRcHRwbVdGNXo0cWVEMmZsdk9jdk1xSk9xX1hqS25VTFl2QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODRacDIweFlsNFdaY2VySjhHTVpYald2bzFwMGluQWwyYzBRTXE2c2FMaG13Z29ROXpQdFd6eThnVk5XTmJCNmt3R3BUeFJhbktLX3pKb2R3RkNsbU4xanNuc1Z4TXhZOXpMUVNhc0oyVDBJMzVhNXN5ZlVwN1FYbmFoYWlCbGJPWG5Ec0h3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMDdRaUdwYnpUZ09hVDdfZlhsbC1ocklGSWJYLW5ROUhBMldkd3pVenZDN25QbzFvTHdCQkVqN3RuWEJQQ2ZuQkh3SmVfaWt1WDNzcmhJYXRQRko3eWdGdlBDT0NGZXV6ajhhNTNpYmlnQnI3cDBVY1VCWkk2Q3JJSHlwN0RZTVY3d2sxSWJSdDlWU3FOWjFpcnRodw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5NamVyYi1TcnY3aC0tc09rbjJjUExQVy1GQnprbk5vVzlpOUtxb01HcHAxRnpSMzF0LVFHVVdEWGhDZmhhVXk3ZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo